## Badges Applied

### Available

The artifact is publicly available in Zenodo. We intend to also make the code in GitHub public, and we intend to do so forever.

### Reusable

The artifacts can be used for the intended purpose of synthesizing certified programs imperative style using Velvet or functional style using pure Lean. 

We have smoke tests for running our pipeline for specification synthesis separately, Velvet synthesis (program + proof) and Lean synthesis(program + proof).

### Functional

Reusable implies Functional.
